#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "This course is intended for individuals who have some experience with quantum computing and want to learn how to write variational algorithms using Qiskit Runtime primitives. It is also suitable for quantum computing professionals who want to expand their knowledge and skills in the field of variational algorithms.\n"
msgid "This course is intended for individuals who have some experience with quantum computing and want to learn how to write variational algorithms using IBM Quantum primitives. It is also suitable for quantum computing professionals who want to expand their knowledge and skills in the field of variational algorithms.\n"
msgstr "هذه الدورة مخصصة لمن لديهم خبرة مسبقة في الحوسبة الكمومية ويرغبون في تعلم كيفية كتابة الخوارزميات التغايرية باستخدام Qiskit Runtime primitives. كما تناسب المتخصصين في الحوسبة الكمومية الراغبين في توسيع معرفتهم ومهاراتهم في مجال الخوارزميات التغايرية.\n"

